KAELEN VANCE: Hold position. Tactical security teams are moving down the main concourse.

3
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,323
DIRECTOR VANE: You're too late, Vance. The activation sequence began five minutes ago.

4
00:00:06,623 --> 00:00:09,952
KAELEN VANCE: There's always time to pull the plug.

5
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,644
NOVA THORNE: Overriding grid capacitors... holding current for ten seconds!

6
00:00:04,944 --> 00:00:07,359
KAELEN VANCE: Transfer the files now!

7
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,956
NOVA THORNE: Relay offline! We bought ourselves twenty-four hours.

8
00:00:05,256 --> 00:00:08,103
KAELEN VANCE: Make every second count.
